  "translation": "Ni u banna, u ye ⟨את⟩ warigwɛ nɔ na masakɛ ni Yehoyada ɲɛfɛ, ka o ye minɛnw ye Yawe so kama — lasarabɔ-minɛnw, sara-latigɛminɛnw, ni kuruw, sanu ni warigwɛ minɛnw. U tun bɛ saraw latigɛ Yawe so kɔnɔ tuma bɛɛ, Yehoyada donw bɛɛ.",
